status GREEN -- tool_letter_room, unshared_citation, index_row_bound, living_docs_lint, tool_path, exec_bit, room_bound, link_witness, reds_citation all green on metal; standing_equipment stays red until the hot pass records index_row_bound's new green in the runs ledger
recommend keep-going -- the fold rule now has a guard on every lap, so the next hand's misfile reds where it is cheapest. The lane's own crux stays Keaton's: mantra/src/main.rye inlines a model mantra/src/weave.rye owns, and both cures rewrite .mantra/'s on-disk record.
